            "gh:lighting": "soft diffused daylight, gentle shadows"
          },
          "panel": 1,
          "shot": "Insert Shot",
          "visual": "机の上のスマホが震える。静かな教室で、着信だけが浮く。"
        },
        {
          "characters": ["character:Ren", "character:Nei"],
          "dialogue": [
            {
              "speaker": "Narration",
              "text": "Ghost Hacker——静けさの中で、通知は牙をむく。"
            }
          ],
          "environment": "env:cschool-classroom",
          "gh:imagePrompt": "Full Page Vertical, ARIA-style. C高校の静かな教室。RenとNei。背後に"パスワード保管庫""メールの別名""闇市場のリスト"が薄く重なるタイトルページ。luminous atmosphere, soft diffused natural light, pristine clean air. shot on 24mm, f/4, cinematic live-action.",
          "gh:runwayPrompt": "Full Page Vertical, ARIA-style. C高校の静かな教室。RenとNei。背後に"パスワード保管庫""メールの別名""闇市場のリスト"が薄く重なるタイトルページ。luminous atmosphere, soft diffused natural light, pristine clean air. shot on 24mm, f/4, cinematic live-action.",
          "gh:shotProperties": {
            "gh:angle": "vertical framing",
            "gh:aperture": "f/4",
            "gh:atmosphere": "ARIA-style: luminous atmosphere, soft diffused natural light, pristine clean air",
            "gh:composition": "strong vertical composition, centered subject",
            "gh:distance": "Wide Shot",
            "gh:focus": "deep focus",
            "gh:lens": "24mm",
            "gh:lighting": "soft diffused daylight, gentle shadows"
          },
          "panel": 2,
          "shot": "Full Page Vertical",
          "visual": "C高校の静かな教室。RenとNei。背後に"パスワード保管庫""メールの別名""闇市場のリスト"が薄く重なるタイトルページ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:act": "act:1-introduction",
      "gh:pageNumber": 4,
      "gh:pageBeat": {
        "gh:emotionalShift": "日常 → 誘惑の発見",
        "gh:hook": "格安で限定品？",
        "gh:tempo": "loose → tempted"
      },
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "characters": ["character:Yuto"],
