          "gh:imagePrompt": "Close-up, ARIA-style. 一瞬だけ"怪しい"がよぎる。けど、画面は"いつもの大手"っぽい。luminous atmosphere, phone glow in dim room. shot on 85mm prime, f/1.2, cinematic live-action.",
          "gh:runwayPrompt": "Close-up, ARIA-style. 一瞬だけ"怪しい"がよぎる。けど、画面は"いつもの大手"っぽい。luminous atmosphere, phone glow in dim room. shot on 85mm prime, f/1.2, cinematic live-action.",
